question:
Hate speech impact the society in following ways:
1) creates enmity and tension, among the various diverse groups in the society;
2) dilutes and threatens the composite culture of India [Art. 51A(b)];
3) restrict the right to life (Art. 21) of individuals against whom hate speech is directed;
4) brings artificial distinction among the citizens (violate right to equality- article 14, 15)
5) against the preamble goals of Justice, equality, liberty and fraternity; and the territorial integrity of India;
